  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 96 * 12 * 15 * 7 * 36 * 77 \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1) –, ÷, +, ×, = \n\n96 * 12 * 15 * 7 * 36 * 77 ⇒ 96 - 12 ÷ 15 + 7 × 36 = 77\n\n⇒ 96 - __**12 **____**÷**____** 15**__ + 7 × 36 = 77\n\n⇒ 96 - 0.8 + __**7 **____**×**____** 36**__ = 77\n\n⇒ __**96 + 252**__ - 0.8 = 77\n\n⇒ __348** - 0.8**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 347.2 ≠ 77 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) –, ×, +, ÷, =\n\n96 * 12 * 15 * 7 * 36 * 77 ⇒ 96 - 12 × 15 + 7 ÷ 36 = 77\n\n⇒ 96 - 12 × 15 + __**7 **____**÷**____** 36**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 96 - __**12 **____**×**____** 15**__ + 0.19 = 77\n\n⇒ __**96 + 0.19**__ - 180 = 77\n\n⇒ __96.19** - 180**__ = 77\n\n⇒ -83.81 ≠ 77 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷, +, ×, –, = \n\n96 * 12 * 15 * 7 * 36 * 77 ⇒ 96 ÷ 12 + 15 × 7 - 36 = 77\n\n⇒ __**96 ÷**____** 12**__ + 15 × 7 - 36 = 77\n\n⇒ 8 + __**15 **____**×**____** 7**__ - 36 = 77\n\n⇒ __**8**____** + 105**__ - 36 = 77\n\n⇒ __113____** - 36**__ = 77\n\n**⇒ 77 = 77 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\n96 * 12 * 15 * 7 * 36 * 77 ⇒ 96 + 12 × 15 - 7 ÷ 36 = 77\n\n⇒ 96 + 12 × 15 - __**7 **____**÷**____** 36**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 96 + __**12 **____**×**____** 15**__ - 0.19 = 77\n\n⇒ __**96 + 180**__ - 0.19 = 77\n\n⇒ __276____** - 0.19**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 275.81 ≠ 77 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
